# Open States v3 API key — free, register at https://open.pluralpolicy.com/
#
# Powers live bill status in the "Statewide Campaign Goals" banner and the
# district lookup behind "Email your state legislators".
#
# Optional. Without it both degrade gracefully: bills still render with their
# demands but show "status unavailable", and the action center links out to
# leg.mn.gov instead of prefilling a mailto.
#
# Local dev: copy this to .env (or .dev.vars for the Cloudflare platform
# proxy). Production: set it as a Worker secret, NOT in this file —
#   wrangler secret put OPENSTATES_API_KEY
OPENSTATES_API_KEY=""
